    "label": {
      "en": "Value for the third share onwards for dependents in QF"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tin_imaxdep_lim2"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The lower per-half-share cap applied within the same family-ratio-capping (Imax) mechanism as $tin_imaxdep_lim1, but for additional half-shares granted for dependents beyond the first two (i.e. from the third half-share onward). Used as Comp_perTU in tinkt_fr's BenCalc under \"Imax: Limit on deductions claimed on behalf of dependents\", consistent with the country report's Table 2.78 cap for each additional half-share after the second."
    },
